  "display_title": "The Male Lead is Mine!",
  "description": "Stuck in the body of a rich and spoiled side character in a romance novel, Aris Horrison is determined not to experience the destitute fortune of her namesake. After deciding to take the plot—and the plotting—into her own hands, Aris starts to romantically pursue the novel’s hero. However, her preemptive strike only pushes the other characters to deviate from the original plot, ultimately sending her little rewrite spinning rapidly out of control. Aris soon begins to wonder if having spoilers about her life is really all it’s cracked up to be… \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
